    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "This repository contains computational data/models utilized to conduct the massive computational experiment reported in the following paper:\r\nShirangi, Mehrdad G. (2019) Closed-loop field development with multipoint geostatistics and statistical performance assessment, Journal of Computational Physics. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcp.2019.04.003\r\n\r\nThe data description is as follows. \r\n- 25_truth_models: contains the folders for 25 truth-case models \r\n- ADGPES_simulation_job: contains input files to run a simulation using ADGPRS\r\n  these data include fluid properties, porosity, relative permeability curves, etc, which are the same for all realizations. \r\n- reals_unc: contains 1100 unconditional realizations generated from the Training Image using the MSCCSIM algorithm. \r\n- training_image: the file containing the training image used to generate all realizations.",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        },
